[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0010","text":"未来……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0020","text":"是啊，绘本在“大团圆结局”就结束了，\n但现实还会继续下去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0030","text":"我在想，甘奈\n是怎么描绘未来的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0040","text":"……未来…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0050","text":"好、好难啊……！\n是什么呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0060","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0070","text":"……？\n千雪小姐……怎么了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0080","text":"啊，抱歉……\n最近，稍微在想一些事情……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0090","text":"……嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0100","text":"……甜花觉得……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0110","text":"……\n梦的尽头，会有什么呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0120","text":"诶、那个……\n…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0130","text":"甜花，不知道……\n……因为，梦……是会结束的东西……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0140","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0150","text":"所、所以……\n睡午觉……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0160","text":"睡午觉的话……\n不管多少次……都能再梦到……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0170","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0180","text":"甜花还真是……不过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0190","text":"……是这个道理呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0200","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04020000_04_0012","text":"Motion"}]
